# CODEOWNERS owns itself (FUL-36). Closes the structural hole where a PR editing
# ONLY this file touched no other owned path. NOTE (FUL-41): like every line
# here, this is INERT at count=0 and gives real tamper-resistance only at
# count>=1 - at which point CODEOWNERS cannot be edited without a Security review.
